=\"καί\">ΚΑ</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Φλαυίου Φιλίππου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Φλαυίου\"><span data-text=\"Φλαυίου\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"Φλάυιος\">ΦΛΙ</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Φιλίππου\"><span data-text=\"Φιλίππου\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"Φίλιππος\">ΦΛΙΠΠΟΥ</span></span></span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Victoria Fendel, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Ἐνθάδε\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"ἐνθάδε\">ΕΝΘΑΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"κεῖται\" data-n=\"10\" data-lemma=\"κεῖμαι\">ΚΕΙΤΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"Εὐτυχιανὸς\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Εὐτυχιανός\">ΕΥΤΥΧΙΑΝΟΣ</span><span data-text=\"ζήσας\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"ζάω\">ΖΗΣΑΣ</span><span data-text=\"ἐν\" data-n=\"25\" data-lemma=\"ἐν\">ΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"Χριστῷ\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Χριστός\">ΧΡΙΣΤΩ</span><span data-text=\"τελευτᾷ\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"τελευτάω\">ΤΕΛΕΥΤΑ</span><span data-text=\"τῇ\" data-n=\"40\" data-lemma=\"ὁ\">ΤΗ</span><span data-text=\"πρὸ\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"πρό\">ΠΡΟ</span><span data-text=\"θ\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"θ\">Θ</span><span data-text=\"καλανδῶν\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"kalendae\">ΚΑΛΑΝΔΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"Αὐγουστῶν\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">ΑΥΓΟΥΣΤΩΝ</span><span data-text=\"ὑπατείᾳ\" data-n=\"65\" data-lemma=\"ὑπατία\">ΥΠΑΤΕΙΑ</span><span data-text=\"Ἀνικίου\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"Ἀνικίας\">ΑΝΙΚΙΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"Αὐχενίου\" data-n=\"75\" data-lemma=\"Αὐχένιος\">ΑΥΧΕΝΙΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"Βάσσου\" data-n=\"80\" data-lemma=\"Βάσσος\">ΒΑΣΣΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"καὶ\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"καί\">ΚΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"Φλαυίου\" data-n=\"90\" data-lemma=\"Φλάυιος\">ΦΛΑΥΙΟΥ</span><span data-text=\"Φιλίππου\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"Φίλιππος\">ΦΙΛΙΠΠΟΥ</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "apparatus",
      "html": "<h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of IGPalermo checked against photograph; Kaibel followed Kirchoff's reedition of the report by Alessi</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 3\">line.3: <span>ΠΡΟΘΕ Alessi</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 5\">line.5: <span>ὑπ(ατείᾳ) IG XIV 535, Agnello; IMusPalermo; ὑπ(ατίᾳ) CIG IV 9478; ΥΠΑΤΙΣ Alessi</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"line 6\">line.6: <span>ΒΑΣΣΥ Κ Alessi</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 6\"><span>ΙΦΛΙΠΠΟΥ lapis</span></span></li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "id": "translation",
      "html": "<h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Here lies Eutychianos, having lived in Christ. He died eight days before the Kalends of August, during the consulship of Anicius Auchenius Bassus and Flavius Philippus.</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "commentary",
      "html": "<h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The epitaph opens at l. 1 with the standard formula <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἐνθάδε κεῖται</span>, followed by the name of the deceased, Eutychianos (for the name in Sicily, see CIL X 7006 = <a href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000005\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000005</a>; LGPN IIIA, 178). The expression <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ζήσας ἐν | Χ(ριστ)ῷ</span> (ll. 2–3) is also attested in other Christian epitaphs (cf. I.Pal.Tertia Ia 258, ll. 3–4) and serves to emphasize the deceased's principal virtue, namely that of being a believer (Agnello 1953, 99). At ll. 3–5, the date of death is introduced by the verb <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">τελευτᾷ</span> and is further specified by the consular dating, during the consulship of Anicius Auchenius Bassus and Flavius Philippus, corresponding to AD 408. Below the text was a symbol that has been interpreted either as an ivy leaf or as an inverted D, representing the Latin abbreviation depositus (Manni Piraino 1973, 31).</p>  "
    },
    {
      "id": "bibliography",
      "html": "<h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Alessi 1833 228 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002538\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002538</a>  </li><li> Alessi 1833 173 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002540\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002540</a>  </li><li> Kirchhoff 1877 9478 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249</a>  </li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">535</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a>  </li><li> Ferrua 1938-1939 29 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001419\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001419</a>  </li><li> Agnello 1953 no.94 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002211</a>  </li><li> Manni Piraino 1973 9 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000531</a>  </li><li> 1976-1977 26.1121 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li><li> Ferrua 1982-1983 12 no.34 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001996\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001996</a>  </li><li> 1986 36.0841 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  "
